# Story core (story/story.js, design/data/story.toml, WP-S1 of design/architecture/story-characters.md). Every `ttl story expect`
# and `ttl rep expect` prints "ttl: ..." when it does not hold (counted as a failure by `server.sh test-all`).
# A refused player command (`execute as <bot> run ttl story ...`) answers the bot in chat and prints nothing here, so every
# refusal below is proved by an `expect` that the state did not change.
# `ttl reset` gives each bot a clean slate (reputation, renown bonus and story state); then the test hook stage ttl.life2 makes
# it a Life 2 soul. Alone (no party layer yet) a bot is a party of one.
# A: the dark route: Oath, Act I by the Oath, Act II lane deltas, renown, flag, Atonement (once), Corruption refused (once per soul).
# B: the light route: Oath, the honour duel and regicide kill costs (`killrep` = what bosses/boss.js `finish` will call),
#    Corruption through the regicide flag, the fight gate (must stand near the arena; ops may start it anywhere).
# Expect in the log: "[ttl] story: TtlBotStoryA swore the dark Oath (oath)", "completed act 1 (forest_awakens, dark)",
# "turned from dark to light", "TtlBotStoryB killed gazel_dwargo: {"dwargon":-60} flag regicide".
# Also check in game (not asserted): the Oath menu (two items; Fallen soul sees the dark one first), `ttl story talk rigurd`
# chat lines and buttons, the #story Discord lines (bots never post).
ttl story testunlock mark
ttlbot spawn TtlBotStoryA
ttlbot spawn TtlBotStoryB
@sleep 2
ttl reset TtlBotStoryA
ttl reset TtlBotStoryB
kubejs stages add TtlBotStoryA ttl.life2
kubejs stages add TtlBotStoryB ttl.life2
# A: nothing sworn yet; the first act needs the Oath.
ttl story expect TtlBotStoryA path none
ttl story expect TtlBotStoryA score 0
ttl story expect TtlBotStoryA stage ttl.path.dark no
ttl story expect TtlBotStoryA stage ttl.path.light no
ttl story expect TtlBotStoryA act 1 no
ttl story expect TtlBotStoryA talk rigurd 1
execute as TtlBotStoryA run ttl story talk rigurd
execute as TtlBotStoryA run ttl story
# A: the dark Oath: path, mirrors, deltas (outcast +20, orc_horde +15, tempest -20), title, Act I, unlocked boss.
execute as TtlBotStoryA run ttl story oath dark
ttl story expect TtlBotStoryA path dark
ttl story expect TtlBotStoryA score 2
ttl story expect TtlBotStoryA stage ttl.path.dark yes
ttl story expect TtlBotStoryA stage ttl.path.light no
ttl story expect TtlBotStoryA stage ttl.story.act1 yes
ttl story expect TtlBotStoryA act 1 yes
ttl story expect TtlBotStoryA acts 1
ttl rep expect TtlBotStoryA outcast value 20
ttl rep expect TtlBotStoryA outcast band friendly
ttl rep expect TtlBotStoryA orc_horde value 15
ttl rep expect TtlBotStoryA tempest value -20
ttl rep expect TtlBotStoryA tempest band unfriendly
ttl story expect TtlBotStoryA title Marked yes
ttl story expect TtlBotStoryA unlocked supermassive_slime yes
ttl story expect TtlBotStoryA talk rigurd 3
# A: the Oath is sworn once; a second one (even the other lane) changes nothing.
execute as TtlBotStoryA run ttl story oath light
ttl discord expect TtlBotStoryA oath_dark 1
ttl discord expect TtlBotStoryA oath_light 0
# The Oath also grants Act I. Its quiet completion must not send a second line.
ttl discord expect TtlBotStoryA act 0
ttl story expect TtlBotStoryA path dark
ttl rep expect TtlBotStoryA tempest value -20
# A: Act II: the dark lane (dwargon -20, outcast +10), renown 5 + 5, Gazel unlocked. Act III first would be refused (not run here).
ttl story act TtlBotStoryA 2
ttl discord expect TtlBotStoryA act 1
ttl story expect TtlBotStoryA act 2 yes
ttl story expect TtlBotStoryA act 3 no
ttl story expect TtlBotStoryA acts 2
ttl rep expect TtlBotStoryA dwargon value -20
ttl rep expect TtlBotStoryA outcast value 30
ttl rep expect TtlBotStoryA renown bonus 10
ttl story expect TtlBotStoryA unlocked gazel_dwargo yes
ttl story expect TtlBotStoryA unlocked veldora no
# A: the dark soul's Gazel and Outcast lines; Shuna refuses only a Hostile soul.
ttl story expect TtlBotStoryA talk gazel 3
ttl story expect TtlBotStoryA talk shuna 2
ttl rep set TtlBotStoryA tempest -60
ttl story expect TtlBotStoryA talk shuna 3
ttl rep set TtlBotStoryA tempest -20
# A: a flag (Demon Lord needs the dark path): stage, title and renown 60.
ttl story flag TtlBotStoryA demon_lord
ttl story expect TtlBotStoryA flag demon_lord yes
ttl story expect TtlBotStoryA stage ttl.story.demon_lord yes
ttl rep expect TtlBotStoryA renown bonus 70
# A: Atonement stays closed until a quest sets the flag; then it works exactly once and swaps the stages.
execute as TtlBotStoryA run ttl story flip
ttl story expect TtlBotStoryA path dark
ttl story expect TtlBotStoryA flips 0
ttl story flag TtlBotStoryA atonement
execute as TtlBotStoryA run ttl story flip
ttl story expect TtlBotStoryA path light
ttl story expect TtlBotStoryA score 1
ttl story expect TtlBotStoryA stage ttl.path.light yes
ttl story expect TtlBotStoryA stage ttl.path.dark no
ttl story expect TtlBotStoryA flips 1
ttl rep expect TtlBotStoryA tempest value 0
ttl story expect TtlBotStoryA title Repentant yes
ttl story expect TtlBotStoryA talk rigurd 2
# A: a second turn is refused even with Corruption's flag set.
ttl story flag TtlBotStoryA regicide
execute as TtlBotStoryA run ttl story flip
ttl story expect TtlBotStoryA path light
ttl story expect TtlBotStoryA flips 1
# B: the light Oath (tempest +20), Act II light lane (dwargon +15).
execute as TtlBotStoryB run ttl story oath light
ttl discord expect TtlBotStoryB oath_light 1
ttl story expect TtlBotStoryB path light
ttl story expect TtlBotStoryB score 1
ttl story expect TtlBotStoryB stage ttl.path.light yes
ttl story expect TtlBotStoryB title Marked no
ttl rep expect TtlBotStoryB tempest value 20
ttl rep expect TtlBotStoryB tempest band friendly
ttl rep expect TtlBotStoryB outcast value 0
ttl story act TtlBotStoryB 2
ttl rep expect TtlBotStoryB dwargon value 15
ttl story expect TtlBotStoryB talk gazel 2
ttl story expect TtlBotStoryB talk rigurd 2
# B: the honour duel costs nothing and the flag is spent; the plain kill is a regicide (dwargon -60) and flags it.
ttl story flag TtlBotStoryB honour_duel
ttl story killrep TtlBotStoryB gazel_dwargo
ttl rep expect TtlBotStoryB dwargon value 15
ttl story expect TtlBotStoryB flag honour_duel no
ttl story expect TtlBotStoryB flag regicide no
ttl story killrep TtlBotStoryB gazel_dwargo
ttl rep expect TtlBotStoryB dwargon value -45
ttl story expect TtlBotStoryB flag regicide yes
ttl story killrep TtlBotStoryB hinata_sakaguchi
ttl rep expect TtlBotStoryB holy_church value -30
# B: Corruption is open through the regicide flag: tempest 20 - 10, outcast +10, path dark.
execute as TtlBotStoryB run ttl story flip
ttl story expect TtlBotStoryB path dark
ttl story expect TtlBotStoryB stage ttl.path.dark yes
ttl story expect TtlBotStoryB stage ttl.path.light no
ttl rep expect TtlBotStoryB tempest value 10
ttl rep expect TtlBotStoryB outcast value 10
ttl story expect TtlBotStoryB flips 1
# B: the fight gate. A bot far from the Orc Lord's camp (1106 539) is refused; ops may start it for the player anywhere.
execute as TtlBotStoryB run ttl story fight orc_lord
@sleep 1
ttl boss expect TtlBotStoryB active orc_lord no
ttl boss cooldown clear orc_lord tests
ttl story fight orc_lord TtlBotStoryB
@sleep 3
ttl boss expect TtlBotStoryB active orc_lord yes
ttl boss abort orc_lord
@sleep 1
ttl boss expect TtlBotStoryB active orc_lord no
# Reset forgets everything (also what `ttl reset` does for the old soul).
ttl story reset TtlBotStoryA
ttl story expect TtlBotStoryA path none
ttl story expect TtlBotStoryA score 0
ttl story expect TtlBotStoryA stage ttl.path.light no
ttl story expect TtlBotStoryA stage ttl.story.act2 no
ttl story expect TtlBotStoryA flag regicide no
ttl story expect TtlBotStoryA flips 0
ttl story expect TtlBotStoryA title Repentant no
ttl story reset TtlBotStoryB
ttl reset TtlBotStoryA
ttl reset TtlBotStoryB
ttlbot remove TtlBotStoryA
ttlbot remove TtlBotStoryB
ttl story testunlock restore
